    "scrpg-battle-of-the-bands": {
      "sceneKey": "opening-act",
      "sourcePages": "330–332",
      "requiredForScenes": [
        "Opening Act",
        "The Headliners"
      ],
      "biography": "Megan Lee spent a lot of time daydreaming. When her dad Rick had talked about spending the summer together, she had thought it would be more exciting than poking rocks, but \"father-daughter bonding time\" turned out to be a series of dig sites as her geologist father measured rocks. At Dig Site 17 in Arizona she fell more than a hundred feet into a quarry and survived. Walking back, she found her rock hammer's metal handle bent; when she grabbed it, her hands covered in rock and she pulled it straight as if it were a paperclip. She spent her junior year discovering her powers — rocky protection and super strength — as things happened to her."
    }
